WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.683
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind typing words and sentences.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.952
Home row: is the resting row for touch typing. Top row: contains letters Q through P.

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:18.105
Bottom row: contains letters Z through M. Practice: helps develop accuracy before

00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:21.210
speed. Posture: keeps shoulders relaxed while typing.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:27.187
With an adult supervising, practise home row and top row using a computer if one is

00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:31.697
available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a partner.
